  "_about": "Fed Pulse measure catalog (data dictionary). Every value in measures.parquet resolves to one entry here. Base measures are extracted from sources; derived measures are computed by pipeline/measures/evaluator.py from one of three patterns (additive, ratio, time_offset). Definitions for derived measures are generated from the calculation unless written here. Entries with display=false are components that exist to make a derived measure honest; the site lists them under their dependents.",
